{"id":"sejchas","lemma":"сейчас","pos":"adv","rank":56,"glosses":["now (presently, at present, at the moment)","now (very recently in the past)","now (very shortly)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B9%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B9%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Где вы сейчас?","en":"Where are you now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681354","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null]},{"text":"Почему ты сейчас говоришь?","en":"Why are you talking now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654105","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Давай сделаем это сейчас.","en":"Let's do it now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283327","words":[{"g":"let's"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я сейчас работаю.","en":"I'm working right now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/727854","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]},{"text":"Где сейчас твой старший брат?","en":"Where's your older brother right now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/674423","words":[{"g":"where"},null,{"g":"your"},{"g":"elder, older, senior"},{"g":"brother"}]}]}